     "<div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">I would revise if the syntax matches the wished model, especially the correlation part.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">You are correlating variables that are already connected through regressions.<br>Use the following code to visualize the model</p>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block\">partable &lt;- lavaan::lavaanify(myModel)\r\nsemPlot::semPaths(partable)\r\n</span></span><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">Best regards,<br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">Yago</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SSB3b3VsZCByZXZpc2UgaWYgdGhlIHN5bnRheCBtYXRjaGVzIHRoZSB3aXNoZWQgbW9kZWwsIGVz\ncGVjaWFsbHkgdGhlIGNvcnJlbGF0aW9uIHBhcnQuPGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5Zb3UgYXJl\nIGNvcnJlbGF0aW5nIHZhcmlhYmxlcyB0aGF0IGFyZSBhbHJlYWR5IGNvbm5lY3RlZCB0aHJvdWdo\nIHJlZ3Jlc3Npb25zLjxicj5CZWxvdyBpcyB5b3VyIGNvZGUsIG1hZGUgd2l0aCB0aGUgY29tbWFu\nZHM6PGJyPjxicj5gYGA8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PnBhcnRhYmxlICZsdDstIGxhdmFhbjo6bGF2YWFuaWZ5\nKG15TW9kZWwpPGJyPnNlbVBsb3Q6OnNlbVBhdGhzKHBhcnRhYmxlKTwvZGl2PjxkaXY+YGBgPC9k\naXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PGltZyBzcmM9ImRhdGE6aW1hZ2UvcG5nO2Jhc2U2NCxpVkJPUncwS0dnb0FB\nQUFOU1VoRVVnQUFBbTRBQUFGSkNBSUFBQUN0aXpaWEFBQWdBRWxFUVZSNG5PM2RPMUxqU2grSDRm\nYXBieW4yQkpSWFlGWmdKaUVpblF5SGtKeU1LcUJxc2tsd2FMS1RFcEdBVjRCWFFCR010UmQvZ1VE\nSXVyUmE2bnZyZmFJWlkwdjZ5NjMrcVhYejVIQTRDQUFBTU5RL3ZoY0FBSUM0RWFVQUFHZ2hTZ0VB\nMEVLVUFnQ2doU2dGQUVBTFVRb0FnQmFpRkFBQUxVUXBBQUJhaUZJQUFMUVFwUUFBYUNGS0FRRFFR\ncFFDQUtDRktBVUFRQXRSQ2dDQUZxSVVBQUF0UkNrQUFGcUlVZ0FBdEJDbEFBQm9JVW9CQU5CQ2xB\nSUFvSVVvQlFCQUMxRUtBSUFXb2hRQUFDMUVLUUFBV29oU0FBQzBFS1VBQUdnaFNnRUEwRUtVQWdD\nZ2hTZ0ZBRUFMVVFvQWdCYWlGQUFBTFVRcEFBQmFpRklBQUxRUXBRQUFhQ0ZLQVFEUVFwUUNBS0NG\nS0FVQVFBdFJDZ0NBRnFJVUFB